                <pb facs="0937" n="825" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg825"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 853.00/91.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Gage to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Lisbon</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1910-10-04"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">October 4,
                    1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Two Portuguese war vessels now bombarding palace in which King now is.
                    Insurrectionists now in possession of two forts.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gage.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
